","text":"Label displayed in the alert message. Main message that should be short, clear, and readable at a glance."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"label"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The status of the alert message. Its background color and its icon color are based on this status. There are two types of statuses (see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertStatus"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"status"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional supplementary text in an alert message. Use only when additional detail or guidance is needed beyond the label. It should remain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"short, clear and scannable, helping the user to understand what happened and what he can do next."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"description"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional list of bullet points to be displayed in the alert message following the label or the optional "},{"code":"description","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"bulletList"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional link to be displayed in the alert message. It can be used to trigger an action."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"link"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional callback invoked when the close button is clicked. If "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the close button is not displayed and the alert message"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remains visible until the context changes (e.g., the issue is resolved, the screen is refreshed). Otherwise, the alert message is dismissable and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"includes a close button, allowing the user to dismiss it when he has acknowledged the message.  Some alerts must remain visible